# How many citations are there in the Data Citation Index?

**Authors:** Daniel Torres-Salinas, Evaristo Jiménez-Contreras, Nicolas Robinson-García

## Summary
Descriptive analysis on the citation distribution of the Thomson Reuters' Data Citation Index by publication type and four broad areas: Science, Engineering &amp; Technology, Humanities &amp; Arts and Social Sciences.


